<!-- wp:group {"className":"ifm-faq","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group ifm-faq"><!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>How long until I show up on the map?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The work is delivered within the time shown on your package. How quickly Google reacts varies: some profile changes show within days, while the effect of new listings builds over several weeks. We cannot promise a position, because Google decides that.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>I do not have a Google Business Profile yet. Can you create one?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes. We set it up with you. Google will then ask you to verify the business, usually by a short video, a phone call or a postcard. Only you can do that step, and we will tell you what to expect.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>I work from home or travel to customers. Does local SEO still work?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes. Google lets you hide your address and list the areas you cover instead. We set your profile up as a service-area business.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Which directories do you use?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Established UK directories and map services that accept your type of business, such as Yell, Bing Places and Apple Maps, plus trade-specific sites where they exist. The full list is in your report.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Do I need a website?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>No, the Google Business Profile package works without one. A website helps though, and the Starter and Growth packages include changes to yours. If you do not have one, see our <a href="/services/website-development/">website packages</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Can you get me more reviews?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We give you a plan and the wording to ask your real customers. We never write, buy or filter reviews. It breaks Google rules and consumer law, and it is your listing that gets suspended.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What happens after a one-off package?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Nothing, unless you want more. Your listings stay live. If you want regular posts, new listings and position checks, the monthly package covers one month at a time.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details --></div>
